# Force these as binary — no line-ending conversion, ever. Without this,
# git's line-ending handling on Windows can warn about (and in some
# configurations alter) bytes inside files that only look text-ish to its
# heuristic but are structurally binary underneath (PDF, docx, model
# weights, images).
*.pdf -text
*.docx -text
*.joblib -text
*.task -text
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
